; Sprite: Willy facing right, walk frame 1
;
; One 16x16 sprite of 32 bytes: 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel), drawn with
; #R$9456. Willy walking to the right (observed: key P gives $85D0 = 2, bit 0 clear), walk frame 1. #R$9637 draws Willy
; from $9D00 + 128*(bit 0 of #R$85D0) + 32*(#R$85D2 AND 3); the lives indicator #R$898B shows frames 0-3 in turn (frame
; counter #R$85E1).
@label=SpriteWillyRight1
b$9D20 DEFB $0F,$00
 $9D22 DEFB $0F,$00
 $9D24 DEFB $1F,$80
 $9D26 DEFB $0D,$00
